        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Modeling convention.&lt;/b&gt; Each lane is a role responsible for its activities. The &lt;b&gt;System&lt;/b&gt; lane is included only to show the automated processing performed by ALAP: checking conditions, validating data, evaluating eligibility, saving information, updating status and sending notifications. Actor lanes contain only human work: entering data, selecting information, viewing results and making decisions that need human judgement. External lanes are services outside ALAP. Numbers follow the activity table." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="596" width="3088" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
